{"data":{"id":9995,"title":"Bài 3: Tích Hợp Log Tracing Tập Trung SLF4J MDC với OpenTelemetry TraceId","description":"<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></p><h3 style=\"line-height:1.355;margin-bottom:4pt;margin-top:8pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bài 3: Tích Hợp Log Tracing Tập Trung SLF4J MDC với OpenTelemetry TraceId</strong></span></span></h3><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bối cảnh nghiệp vụ</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">:</span></span></p><p style=\"line-height:1.355;margin-bottom:5pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Khi xảy ra sự cố lỗi giao dịch chuyển khoản hoặc AI phản hồi sai lệch, kỹ sư DevOps cần tra cứu log của ứng dụng Spring Boot. Nếu log ứng dụng và trace trên Langfuse Dashboard không có mã định danh liên kết, việc điều tra nguyên nhân gốc rễ (Root Cause Analysis) sẽ tốn rất nhiều thời gian. Ta cần đồng bộ hóa&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>TraceId</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> của OpenTelemetry vào nhật ký log của Spring Boot qua&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>MDC (Mapped Diagnostic Context)</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Nhiệm vụ triển khai</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">:</span></span></p><ol style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:decimal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Xây dựng `TraceMdcFilter.java`:</strong></span></span></li></ol><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tạo lớp&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">TraceMdcFilter</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> kế thừa&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">OncePerRequestFilter</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> (hoặc&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">HandlerInterceptor</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">).</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Trích xuất&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">traceId</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> từ ngữ cảnh OpenTelemetry hiện tại:&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Span.current().getSpanContext().getTraceId()</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Nạp&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">traceId</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> vào SLF4J MDC:&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">MDC.put(\"trace_id\", traceId)</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Cơ chế an toàn:</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Bắt buộc sử dụng khối&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">try-finally</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> để thực hiện&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">MDC.clear()</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> sau khi request kết thúc, ngăn ngừa rò rỉ bộ nhớ và nhiễm chéo dữ liệu giữa các thread trong Thread Pool (Tomcat Worker Threads).</span></span></li></ul><ol style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\" start=\"2\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:decimal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Cấu hình Log Pattern (`logback-spring.xml`):</strong></span></span></li></ol><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Tạo file cấu hình log (hoặc cấu hình logging trong&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">application.yml</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">) để định dạng mọi dòng log đều in ra mã&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">[%X{trace_id}]</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Format mẫu:&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">%d{yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss.SSS} [%thread] %-5level [%X{trace_id:-NO_TRACE}] %logger{36} - %msg%n</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">.</span></span></li></ul><ol style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\" start=\"3\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:decimal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"2\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Phân tích kỹ thuật:</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> Giải thích cơ chế ThreadLocal của MDC và rủi ro rò rỉ bộ nhớ / sai lệch log khi tái sử dụng thread trong Thread Pool.</span></span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Yêu cầu đầu ra</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">:</span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Mã nguồn Java class&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">TraceMdcFilter.java</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> và file cấu hình&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">logback-spring.xml</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bài phân tích kỹ thuật về cơ chế ThreadLocal và quản lý vòng đời MDC.</span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Đóng gói mã nguồn bài tập trong một project độc lập và đẩy lên GitHub (nộp kèm link GitHub Repository riêng cho bài này).</strong></span></span></li><li style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:'Noto Sans Symbols',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;list-style-type:disc;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Minh chứng chạy thực tế</strong></span><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">: Dán đoạn log console thực tế của Spring Boot khi xử lý 1 request, chứng minh tất cả các dòng log từ Filter -&gt; Service -&gt; Controller đều hiển thị chung một giá trị&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#12324a;font-family:Consolas,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">trace_id</span></span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#263238;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">.</span></span></li></ul>","createdBy":"84","createdAt":"2026-08-20T08:38:51.000Z","updatedAt":null,"updatedBy":null,"status":1,"position":7537,"tutorial":"","gradingCriteria":"Mã nguồn TraceMdcFilter (35% số điểm): Trích xuất đúng TraceId từ OTel Context và nạp vào MDC.\nQuản lý vòng đời MDC.clear() trong finally (25% số điểm): Giải phóng MDC chuẩn xác, bảo vệ thread pool an toàn.\nCấu hình Logback Pattern (25% số điểm): Cấu hình log pattern chính xác, hiển thị đẹp mắt và hỗ trợ giá trị fallback khi không có trace.\nĐóng gói Project, link GitHub Repo riêng & Log thực nghiệm (15% số điểm): Project độc lập có link GitHub riêng và log console chứng minh tính đồng bộ.\n","sampleLink":"","expectedTime":0},"statusCode":200}